DreamSlider:SliderBarColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSlider.h#DreamSlider:SliderBarColor
    src   "A tint over the bar the handle travels along -- UMG's SliderBarColor, which is a tint over\nSSlider's bar image for exactly the same reason this is one: the STYLE says what the slider\nlooks like, and this says what is happening to it right now. White is no opinion."
    text  "覆盖在手柄所沿轨道条上的着色——即 UMG 的 SliderBarColor，它对\nSSlider 的条状图像着色，原因与本项完全相同：STYLE 决定滑块\n外观，而本项决定它此刻正发生什么。白色即不作任何表态。"
    state machine
}

