DreamSlider:StepSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSlider.h#DreamSlider:StepSize
    src   "The quantum a MOUSE drag moves the value in, while bMouseUsesStep is on -- UMG's StepSize.\n\nAbsolute, where NavigationChangeInterval above is a fraction, and each says which input it\ngoverns: re-pointing navigation at this number would silently re-scale every slider already\nauthored against this plugin. See UUISlider::StepSize for the full argument."
    text  "bMouseUsesStep 开启时，MOUSE 拖动改变值的步长——即 UMG 的 StepSize。\n\n此处为绝对值，而上面的 NavigationChangeInterval 是比例；两者各自说明\n自己管辖哪种输入：把导航改为引用此数值，会静默地重新缩放所有已按本插件\n制作的滑块。完整论述见 UUISlider::StepSize。"
    state machine
}

DreamSlider:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSlider.h#DreamSlider:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why\nit stays editable instead of being gated on the enum: the old edit condition greyed the\nexact values that were driving the control."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 如此指定且确实存在样式表时，\n项目样式表优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这就是实际生效的外观——因此\n它保持可编辑，而不是由枚举控制：旧的编辑条件恰恰把\n正在驱动控件的那些值置灰了。"
    state machine
}

